{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54983","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军袂，蓦地起飞腾。\n上备将军倾折象（京本作「逝相」），难禳兵衆敌相凌（京本作「急须禳厌敌相临」），火急整回程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}